{"id":"a4c575bb1780ff55","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-vertex-refinement.md","title":"顶点颜色细化与稳定分割","display":"df-vertex-refinement — 顶点颜色细化与稳定分割","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-vertex-refinement","aliases":["29-df-vertex-refinement"],"display":"df-vertex-refinement — 顶点颜色细化与稳定分割","depends_on":["[[29-df-colored-graph]]"],"source_locator":"§12.5, pp.189–190, DjVu scans 204–205","source_basis":"正文及图12.26已视觉核对；以等价关系重构原书颜色编号算法"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-vertex-refinement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-vertex-refinement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vertex-refinement — 顶点颜色细化与稳定分割"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd6d5729a326908a\" href=\"?note=dd6d5729a326908a\" title=\"29-df-colored-graph\">29-df-colored-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§12.5, pp.189–190, DjVu scans 204–205"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"正文及图12.26已视觉核对；以等价关系重构原书颜色编号算法"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E^G,C_1^G,\\ldots,C_r^G)\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\">\\(G=(V,E^G,C_1^G,\\ldots,C_r^G)\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|V|\\geq1\">\\(n=|V|\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Col}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{Col}_G\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd6d5729a326908a\" href=\"?note=dd6d5729a326908a\" title=\"29-df-colored-graph\">29-df-colored-graph</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in V\">\\(u,v\\in V\\)</span>。本条保留全部一元谓词的真值组合为初始颜色；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=0\">\\(r=0\\)</span> 时所有顶点初始同色。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{G,m}\">\\(\\equiv_{G,m}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[v]_{G,m}\">\\([v]_{G,m}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{G,m}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{G,m}\\)</span> 依次由下式作良基递归；不为各颜色类额外选代表元或数字编号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\equiv_{G,0}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Col}_G(u)=\\operatorname{Col}_G(v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\equiv_{G,0}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Col}_G(u)=\\operatorname{Col}_G(v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[v]_{G,m}\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:u\\equiv_{G,m}v\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{G,m}\\coloneqq\\{[v]_{G,m}:v\\in V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[v]_{G,m}\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:u\\equiv_{G,m}v\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{G,m}\\coloneqq\\{[v]_{G,m}:v\\in V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\equiv_{G,m+1}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nu\\equiv_{G,m}v\\land\n\\forall D\\in\\mathcal P_{G,m}\\;\n|\\{w\\in D:E^G(u,w)\\}|=|\\{w\\in D:E^G(v,w)\\}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\equiv_{G,m+1}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nu\\equiv_{G,m}v\\land\n\\forall D\\in\\mathcal P_{G,m}\\;\n|\\{w\\in D:E^G(u,w)\\}|=|\\{w\\in D:E^G(v,w)\\}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_G\\coloneqq\\min\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\mathcal P_{G,m}=\\mathcal P_{G,m+1}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{G,\\infty}\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{G,T_G},\\qquad\nu\\equiv_{G,\\infty}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ u\\equiv_{G,T_G}v.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_G\\coloneqq\\min\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\mathcal P_{G,m}=\\mathcal P_{G,m+1}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{G,\\infty}\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{G,T_G},\\qquad\nu\\equiv_{G,\\infty}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ u\\equiv_{G,T_G}v.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_G\\leq n-1,\\qquad\n\\forall m\\geq T_G\\;\\mathcal P_{G,m}=\\mathcal P_{G,T_G}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_G\\leq n-1,\\qquad\n\\forall m\\geq T_G\\;\\mathcal P_{G,m}=\\mathcal P_{G,T_G}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.5，印刷页189–190、扫描页204–205。原书给颜色元组排序后重新编号，本条只记录产生的同色等价关系，避免把不同轮的任意数字名称当作数学对象。对每轮作归纳可知上述关系为等价关系，下一分割细化上一分割；若分割未稳定，其非空块数严格增加，至多为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。故最迟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-1\">\\(n-1\\)</span> 轮稳定，最小值存在；相邻分割相等后邻居计数条件不再分裂任何块，之后保持不变。这里的初始颜色真值组合在有限图中可重编码为互斥且穷尽的颜色类，故覆盖原书该节使用的恰一颜色约定。图12.26仅作为算法示意核对，未将其具体颜色编号录为新定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-colored-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dd6d5729a326908a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-colored-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-colored-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dd6d5729a326908a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$r\\in\\mathbb N$，$G=(V,E^G,C_1^G,\\ldots,C_r^G)\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r$，$n=|V|\\geq1$；$\\operatorname{Col}_G$ 取 [[29-df-colored-graph]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,E^G,C_1^G,\\ldots,C_r^G)\\in\\mathrm{CGraph}_r","display":false},{"tex":"n=|V|\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Col}_G","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"r=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{G,m}","display":false},{"tex":"[v]_{G,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{G,m}","display":false},{"tex":"u\\equiv_{G,0}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Col}_G(u)=\\operatorname{Col}_G(v).","display":true},{"tex":"[v]_{G,m}\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:u\\equiv_{G,m}v\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{G,m}\\coloneqq\\{[v]_{G,m}:v\\in V\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"u\\equiv_{G,m+1}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nu\\equiv_{G,m}v\\land\n\\forall D\\in\\mathcal P_{G,m}\\;\n|\\{w\\in D:E^G(u,w)\\}|=|\\{w\\in D:E^G(v,w)\\}|.","display":true},{"tex":"T_G\\coloneqq\\min\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\mathcal P_{G,m}=\\mathcal P_{G,m+1}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{G,\\infty}\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{G,T_G},\\qquad\nu\\equiv_{G,\\infty}v\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ u\\equiv_{G,T_G}v.","display":true},{"tex":"T_G\\leq n-1,\\qquad\n\\forall m\\geq T_G\\;\\mathcal P_{G,m}=\\mathcal P_{G,T_G}.","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n-1","display":false}],"bytes":2286,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-vertex-refinement]]、[[29-thm-vertex-refinement-ck]] — 顶点颜色细化与 C² 类型"},{"id":"531861035d8c6707","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2985e9c09cdf49eb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\equiv_{G,m}$、$\\equiv_{G,\\infty}$ 取 [[29-df-vertex-refinement]]；$C^2_{\\tau_r}$、$\\operatorname{vars}$、$\\operatorname{fv}$、$\\mathrm{qr}_C$、$\\models_C$ 取 [[29-df-ck]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-vertex-refinement]]"}],"outgoing":["dd6d5729a326908a"]}